WEBVTT

00:04:27.100 --> 00:04:30.455
Jini si uji, miqte e mi. (Duartrokitje)

00:04:30.455 --> 00:04:34.557
YR: Kete vit, mbush 32 vjec,

00:04:34.557 --> 00:04:37.676
kaq vjec ishte edhe Bruce Lee kur nderroi jete.

00:04:37.676 --> 00:04:40.270
Kohet e fudnit kam vrare mendjen,

00:04:40.270 --> 00:04:42.200
se cfare keshille do te me jepte sot

00:04:42.200 --> 00:04:44.226
rreth ketij fjalimi TED

00:04:44.226 --> 00:04:48.170
po te ish ende gjalle.

00:04:48.170 --> 00:04:51.908
HP: Mos e imito zerin tim.

00:04:51.908 --> 00:04:53.979
Me ofendon.

00:04:53.979 --> 00:04:56.009
(Te qeshura)

00:04:56.009 --> 00:04:57.760
YR: Keshille e mire,

00:04:57.760 --> 00:05:01.472
por une vazhdoj te jem i mendimit se ne mesojme kush jemi